WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.972
was angry at the guard at the southern gate of Heaven.

2
00:00:16.812 --> 00:00:18.853
"Why can't you close the gate and dim the stars?"

3
00:00:19.894 --> 00:00:21.095
The guard looked nervous.

4
00:00:21.115 --> 00:00:24.517
"I can do that only if I have permission from the Jade Emperor."

5
00:00:24.537 --> 00:00:28.979
"I'm trying to save the Tang Monk!"

6
00:00:29.339 --> 00:00:30.140
cried Wukong.

7
00:00:30.848 --> 00:00:32.869
"A demon is planning to eat him."

8
00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:35.691
sorry," said the guard.

9
00:00:35.711 --> 00:00:37.372
"But I can't help you."

10
00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:41.654
Wukong's eyes became dark and angry.

11
00:00:42.434 --> 00:00:44.756
He pulled the iron bar out of his ear.

12
00:00:49.298 --> 00:00:52.020
A messenger ran into the Cloud Palace and bowed.

13
00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:56.082
"Sun Wukong is at the southern gate of Heaven, Your Majesty.

14
00:00:57.002 --> 00:00:59.624
He's going to destroy Heaven if we don't do what he says."

15
00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:03.221
The Jade Emperor slammed his fist down.

16
00:01:04.161 --> 00:01:04.882
rotten monkey!

17
00:01:05.222 --> 00:01:05.902
What does he want?"

18
00:01:06.983 --> 00:01:10.924
"He wants us to close the gate and dim the stars," said the messenger.

19
00:01:10.944 --> 00:01:14.706
"Why?" asked the emperor.

20
00:01:14.726 --> 00:01:18.847
"He wants to pretend Heaven got sucked into a gourd," said the messenger.

21
00:01:20.428 --> 00:01:22.429
Jade Emperor looked confused.

22
00:01:22.449 --> 00:01:24.370
"Why does he want to do that?"

23
00:01:24.470 --> 00:01:27.171
"He didn't say," said the messenger.

24
00:01:27.191 --> 00:01:30.232
"He just said he's trying to save the Tang Monk."

25
00:01:31.972 --> 00:01:33.493
The Jade Emperor sighed.

26
00:01:33.513 --> 00:01:37.096
"You have my permission to close the gate and dim the stars.

27
00:01:38.036 --> 00:01:40.198
I don't want any more trouble from that monkey."

28
00:01:43.059 --> 00:01:44.701
The messenger returned to the gate.

29
00:01:44.721 --> 00:01:48.143
"We will close the gate and dim the stars," he said.

30
00:01:50.224 --> 00:01:50.985
said Wukong.

31
00:01:51.645 --> 00:01:53.706
He put the iron bar back in his ear.

32
00:01:54.587 --> 00:01:56.068
"Wait until I say 'Heaven.'"

33
00:02:01.676 --> 00:02:06.019
Wukong returned to his body, which was still in disguise as a demon.

34
00:02:06.039 --> 00:02:10.242
"Now I will call to Heaven," said the monkey to the demon.

35
00:02:10.262 --> 00:02:13.284
"The whole place will get sucked into this gourd."

36
00:02:14.284 --> 00:02:15.425
He held up the gourd.

37
00:02:15.445 --> 00:02:21.069
"Heaven!" Right away the sky went dark.

38
00:02:24.451 --> 00:02:25.232
cried the demon.

39
00:02:25.252 --> 00:02:28.274
"All of Heaven is now in that gourd?"

40
00:02:29.835 --> 00:02:31.456
"Yes," said Wukong.

41
00:02:32.284 --> 00:02:35.645
"All the stars, planets, spirits, and gods are in here.

42
00:02:36.725 --> 00:02:40.226
Even the Cloud Palace is in here, with the Jade Emperor too!

43
00:02:42.007 --> 00:02:43.247
I will let Heaven back out."

44
00:02:44.367 --> 00:02:45.668
He held up the gourd.

45
00:02:45.688 --> 00:02:47.248
"Heaven, return!"

46
00:02:48.729 --> 00:02:50.069
The sky lit up again.

47
00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:54.010
said the demon.

48
00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:59.031
"Let's trade gourds!"

49
00:02:59.131 --> 00:03:00.912
He handed his gourd to Wukong.

50
00:03:01.812 --> 00:03:04.233
Wukong gave the fake gourd to the demon.

51
00:03:05.494 --> 00:03:09.415
Then he made the real gourd tiny and hid it in his robe.

52
00:03:13.717 --> 00:03:16.958
try to capture Heaven now," said the demon.

53
00:03:18.099 --> 00:03:19.379
He held up the gourd.

54
00:03:19.399 --> 00:03:23.601
"Heaven!" Nothing happened.

55
00:03:24.821 --> 00:03:27.162
"Heaven!" said the demon again.

56
00:03:27.182 --> 00:03:28.903
"Heaven! Heaven!"

57
00:03:30.023 --> 00:03:31.084
He looked at the gourd.

58
00:03:33.668 --> 00:03:35.349
gourd isn't working.

59
00:03:35.369 --> 00:03:37.810
What's wrong with it?"

60
00:03:40.011 --> 00:03:43.392
Wukong laughed and made the fake gourd disappear.

61
00:03:44.133 --> 00:03:46.094
Then he made himself invisible.

62
00:03:47.514 --> 00:03:48.575
was tricked!"

63
00:03:48.935 --> 00:03:49.695
cried the demon.

64
00:03:49.715 --> 00:03:52.857
"I must tell Golden Horn."

65
00:03:54.697 --> 00:03:57.298
The demon ran off, and Wukong followed.

66
00:03:59.099 --> 00:04:00.560
the road went up a mountain.

67
00:04:05.108 --> 00:04:06.569
The demon ran into a cave.

68
00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:10.933
Wukong made himself visible and stormed into the cave.

69
00:04:14.276 --> 00:04:18.340
Looking around at the group of demons, he pulled out his iron bar.

70
00:04:19.481 --> 00:04:20.481
my friends at once!"

71
00:04:20.782 --> 00:04:21.402
he shouted.

72
00:04:21.422 --> 00:04:24.365
"Or I'll clobber all of you!"

73
00:04:24.445 --> 00:04:28.648
"Ahh!" cried the small demons.

74
00:04:29.229 --> 00:04:32.532
They ran in every direction, tripping over one another.

75
00:04:35.348 --> 00:04:37.989
Wukong swung his iron bar at Golden Horn.

76
00:04:38.789 --> 00:04:42.650
The demon stepped out of the way and pulled a golden rope from his sleeve.

77
00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:46.151
He swung the rope, and it shot toward Wukong.

78
00:04:47.872 --> 00:04:51.213
The monkey tried to get out of the way, but the rope snagged him.

79
00:04:52.173 --> 00:04:53.573
It looped around his waist.

80
00:04:54.594 --> 00:04:58.135
The more Wukong tried to wriggle free, the tighter the rope got.

81
00:05:01.396 --> 00:05:02.296
Horn laughed.

82
00:05:03.796 --> 00:05:06.423
"You'll never escape the golden rope.

83
00:05:07.565 --> 00:05:11.294
Tonight I will dine on the Tang Monk!"
